    "expected_outcomes": "Increased moderate-to-vigorous physical activity (150-300 minutes/week) leading to a 33% lower risk of all-cause mortality. Improved cardiorespiratory fitness, reduced risk of chronic diseases (e.g., type 2 diabetes, hypertension, certain cancers), enhanced mental health (reduced anxiety and depression), and improved sleep quality. Specific effect sizes vary by outcome and population, with consistent activity showing dose-response benefits.",
