    "description": "This protocol outlines an evidence-based approach to COPD self-management, designed for implementation by Respiratory Therapists within population health teams. It focuses on empowering patients with COPD to actively manage their condition, improve health-related quality of life, and reduce hospital admissions through structured education and support.",
