    "expected_outcomes": "Expected outcomes include an increased rate of PPD screening among target populations, earlier identification of PPD symptoms, and improved linkage to mental health services. While specific effect sizes are not yet established for doula-led PPD screening, evidence suggests that doula support can lead to improved maternal mental health outcomes [1, 2]. Successful implementation is anticipated to reduce the duration and severity of PPD episodes and enhance overall maternal and infant well-being.",
