    "implementation_guidance": "Successful implementation of the CDSMP within Medicaid and vulnerable populations requires a multi-faceted approach grounded in the Consolidated Framework for Implementation Research (CFIR). This involves integrating the program into existing healthcare structures like Medicaid Health Homes and Home and Community-Based Services (HCBS) waivers, which necessitates aligning program delivery and billing with state-specific Medicaid services. A culturally responsive evaluation (CRE) approach is crucial to tailor the program to the specific cultural and contextual needs of the community, thereby addressing potential barriers to participation and improving engagement among underresourced populations. Key to this is building strong partnerships with healthcare providers and community organizations to ensure the program is delivered by trusted individuals and is accessible to the target population.",
