    "expected_outcomes": "Expected outcomes include a reduction in depressive symptoms (e.g., measured by PHQ-9 scores, with an anticipated effect size comparable to other BA interventions, typically moderate to large), increased engagement in meaningful activities, improved quality of life, and enhanced self-efficacy. Long-term outcomes may include reduced hospitalizations and improved social functioning.",
