    "description": "This protocol outlines evidence-based strategies for smoking cessation among pregnant women, focusing on psychosocial, behavioral, and pharmacotherapy interventions. It emphasizes comprehensive screening, motivational feedback, and continuous support to improve maternal and infant health outcomes.",
